  <name>PATM</name>
  <summary>Pipeline Automation Tool Manager</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      PATM is a desktop application for database automation and management.
      Connect to PostgreSQL, MySQL, or MariaDB; browse tables; write and execute
      SQL queries with selection execution; use built-in tools for CSV export and
      table transfers; and extend functionality with custom Python tools.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Multi-database support (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB)</li>
      <li>SQL query editor with syntax-aware selection execution</li>
      <li>SQL terminal with command history</li>
      <li>Built-in CSV export and table transfer tools</li>
      <li>User-editable Python tools with sandboxed execution</li>
      <li>Secure credential storage via system keyring</li>
      <li>Multiple theme options (Fusion, Breeze, Classic, Windows 9x)</li>
      <li>Built-in installer and uninstaller wizard</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
